<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch share market closed for New Year's Day.</title>
<headline>Dutch share market closed for New Year's Day.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch stock market is closed for the New Year holiday on January 1 and will reopen on Thursday, January 2.</p>
<p>Shares closed at a new all-time closing high on Monday ahead of the holiday, with the AEX index of leading shares up 9.15 points to 648.24.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000, fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
